  "text": "This rover was built to last 90 days on Mars. It lasted more than 14 years. Dust should have choked its solar panels within months. Instead, Martian wind kept sweeping them clean. Then in 2018, a storm wrapped the whole planet and the sky went dark. The full film, Could a Robot Survive on Mars?",
